          "end": 396,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.110.070:block:1",
          "start": 231
        },
        "quote": "(b) Eligibility – Permanent Reduction in Force. Severance pay set forth herein is available only to employees who meet all of the following eligibility requirements:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.110.070:block:1#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.110.070 block 2",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 2,
          "component_id": "8f58c61e-36ef-546a-aab3-e113d80f9dd5",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 478,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.110.070:block:2",
          "start": 397
        },
        "quote": "(1) The employee’s position has been eliminated pursuant to a reduction in force;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.110.070:block:2#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.110.070 block 3",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 3,
          "component_id": "17c3daa8-761b-5a3a-a423-1a1948051576",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 572,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.110.070:block:3",
          "start": 479
        },
        "quote": "(2) The employee has been employed with the City for one or more continuous years of service;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.110.070:block:3#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.110.070 block 4",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 4,
          "component_id": "b18c1b99-30dc-50ea-b815-6fa915429bf6",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 706,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.110.070:block:4",
          "start": 573
        },
        "quote": "(3) The employee has not accepted a position with the City or with another governmental entity pursuant to a consolidation agreement;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.110.070:block:4#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.110.070 block 5",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 5,
          "component_id": "1ed6d8e2-48a6-565b-828b-cee64d51f88c",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 854,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.110.070:block:5",
          "start": 707
        },
        "quote": "(4) The employee has not accepted a transfer of employment to an entity that is assuming operational responsibility via contract with the City; and",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.110.070:block:5#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
