          "end": 1465,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.110.070:block:9",
          "start": 1182
        },
        "quote": "Length of Service | Separation Pay\nZero to Less Than One Year | Zero\nOne Year to Less than Ten Years | One week’s salary for each complete year of service, as of the date of separation\nOver Ten Years | Two weeks’ salary for each complete year of service, as of the date of separation",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.110.070:block:9#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
